  ('leonohebe-cupressoides', 'Leonohebe cupressoides', null, 'Cypress hebe', null, 'contested', false, false, false, 'C2', true, 'SP-086', 'C2: One species written twice in every master list (Master Plant List rows 44 and 92)? Threatened flag is on the Veronica row only.', '{"commonName":"Cypress hebe","maoriNames":[],"nameNote":"NZPCN lists Leonohebe cupressoides as a synonym of Veronica cupressoides. WRT’s SP-086 and SP-155 remain separate pending its identity ruling; these are synonym-based illustrations, not proof of the identity of recorded plantings.","summary":"An aromatic native shrub of eastern South Island scrub. Fine branchlets and tiny scale leaves give it a cypress-like outline.","lookFor":"Slender green to blue-green branchlets with small triangular leaves clasping the stem. Small pale blue or mauve flowers occur near the tips.","sources":[{"label":"NZPCN","url":"https://www.nzpcn.org.nz/flora/species/veronica-cupressoides/"}],"checkedOn":"2026-10-04","photoCheck":{"status":"partial","reason":"Botanical synonym confirmed; WRT database identity remains unresolved.","summary":"These photos illustrate the verified Veronica cupressoides synonym. WRT’s separate records still need an identity ruling.","checkedOn":"2026-10-04"}}'::jsonb, '[{"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6c/Veronica_cupressoides2_at_WBG.jpg/960px-Veronica_cupressoides2_at_WBG.jpg","width":960,"height":1280,"caption":"Cypress hebe reference under the verified synonym Veronica cupressoides: scale leaves and jointed green branchlets.","author":"Siobhan Leachman","license":"CC0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/deed.en","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Veronica_cupressoides2_at_WBG.jpg","articleUrl":"https://www.nzpcn.org.nz/flora/species/veronica-cupressoides/","retrievedAt":"2026-10-04","focalPoint":"50% 50%","sourceName":"Wikimedia Commons","articleLabel":"NZPCN species reference"},{"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.