  ('olearia-nummularifolia', 'Olearia nummularifolia', 'Olearia nummulariifolia', null, null, 'contested', false, false, false, 'C7', true, 'SP-117', 'C7: Is the cymbifolia variety its own line or folded into the parent?', '{"commonName":null,"maoriNames":[],"nameNote":"NZPCN now uses Shawia nummulariifolia, with Olearia nummulariifolia as a synonym. WRT’s recorded spelling Olearia nummularifolia is retained. Its separate cymbifolia line remains for WRT to resolve; no quantities or IDs are merged.","summary":"A bushy native shrub of subalpine country. Its compact, leathery leaves have pale undersides.","lookFor":"Small yellow-green oval leaves with rolled-under edges and white undersides. Sticky yellow twigs bear small clusters of white daisy flowers.","sources":[{"label":"NZPCN","url":"https://www.nzpcn.org.nz/flora/species/shawia-nummulariifolia/"}],"checkedOn":"2026-10-04","photoCheck":{"status":"partial","reason":"Botanical references confirmed; WRT database boundary or spelling decision remains unresolved.","summary":"References use Shawia nummulariifolia. WRT must confirm its recorded spelling and separate cymbifolia entry.","checkedOn":"2026-10-04"}}'::jsonb, '[{"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b9/Olearia_nummulariifolia_in_Dunedin_Botanic_Garden_10.jpg/960px-Olearia_nummulariifolia_in_Dunedin_Botanic_Garden_10.jpg","width":960,"height":561,"caption":"Olearia nummulariifolia in Dunedin Botanic Garden, Dunedin, New Zealand Reference for the verified Shawia nummulariifolia synonym; database spelling retained.","author":"Krzysztof Golik","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Olearia_nummulariifolia_in_Dunedin_Botanic_Garden_10.jpg","articleUrl":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Olearia_nummulariifolia","retrievedAt":"2026-10-04","focalPoint":"50% 50%","sourceName":"Wikimedia Commons"},{"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons